<item>
<title>Russia's war in Ukraine: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ukraine/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ukraine-2026-11-13T01:59:48.441Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 01:59:48 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Ukraine launched drones that hit Russia's largest oil refinery in Siberia, while Russian forces killed a Zaporizhzhia nuclear plant worker in a drone strike and struck a Ukrainian drone in Russia's Smolensk region, killing two people. Russia reported intercepting 146 drones in the Leningrad region and a drone that wounded three energy workers in Sumy Oblast. A U.S.-mediated prisoner swap was concluded in Abu Dhabi, but broader peace talks ended without a breakthrough. The conflict caused 75,767 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.washingtonpost.com/world/2026/11/10/us-army-officer-arrested-uk-suspicion-trying-steal-secrets-russia/&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dw.com/en/eu-leaders-tussle-over-who-to-send-to-ukraine-russia-peace-talks/a-79935468?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf&quot;&gt;Deutsche Welle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/12/regional-security-dominates-european-talks-in-dublin-amid-hybrid-attacks?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261112-winter-is-coming-putin-seeks-to-hammer-ukrainians-their-power-grid-their-water-supplies&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ft.com/content/783504cd-aa28-453a-a223-7a34eee86ce8?syn-25a6b1a6=1&quot;&gt;Financial Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/live/2026/nov/12/us-envoys-in-moscow-meeting-putin-abu-dhabi-trilateral-ukraine-ceasefire-talks-latest-news-updates&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168761&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxQSEE5cWtLcWNYUk1pWEVTeF9uc3pYQlZnTUp3VWNJSV83d1VBVDJHOW1OeFB4Qk5QLTI4TWw4a